@startuml
title Automação do contrato WireMock
actor "Teste Python" as Python
actor "k6 (GitHub Actions + manual)" as k6
component "WireMock local :8080" as WM
collections "mappings/*.json" as stub
database "__files/cars.json" as catalog
Python --> WM : GET /api/cars
POST /api/cars
k6 --> WM : GET /api/cars
POST /api/cars
WM --> stub : escolher cenário
WM --> catalog : GET - arquivo fixo
note right of stub
  fusca: 201
  up tsi: 500 simulado
  outro modelo: 404
end note
note bottom of WM
  Sem persistência ou autenticação;
  porta vinculada a localhost.
end note
@enduml
